      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n**Please note children are not permitted at viewings***\n\nFULL RENOVATION PROJECT WITH HUGE POTENTIAL TO EXTEND THE EXISTING PROPERTY AND DEVELOP THE REAR GARDEN (S.P.P.)\n\nDNG are delighted to represent the sale of 58 Collins Park, Beaumont, a spacious three bedroom semi-detached home in need of full modernisation throughout. The property offers bright and spacious accommodation and boasts a large 100 ft. long rear garden with side access via a wide shared laneway.\n\nThe accommodation extends to a total floor area of approx. 110 sq. m. and comprises - Entrance hallway, front living room, dining room, kitchen with a door to the side garage/storage room, three bedrooms and a bathroom.\n\nThe area boasts a host of local amenities and services including a selection of excellent schools, recreational and sports facilities, churches, shops, pubs and cafes. Both Artane and Omni Shopping Centres are within close reach. The area is serviced by buses both from Collins Avenue and Malahide Road and the M1 and M50 motorways are on the doorstep. The property is also within a 5-minute drive from both DCU and Beaumont Hospital, Dublin Airport is only 10 minute drive and Dublin City Centre is a short 4kms distance away. Locations don't come much more family friendly and convenient."
      },
